@module level5data ; Level 5
@about The level's body: the header the game reads at $C4AE, the sprites, the object table, the metatiles, the map, the wave script, the enemy kinds and their movement scripts, the two mover tables and the movers.
$C4AE b L5Header ; The level header: restart point, checkpoints and the pointers the game reads
> Restart column $00, restart wave $0000; checkpoint columns $00, $23, $FF with wave entries $D62C, $D8E8, $DA5A; objects $D14E, map $D4BA, kinds $DEC4, movers $E1AC and $E1C8.
$C4AF L5RestartWave ; the wave entry a life restarts at (the game keeps its live copy here)
$C4B1 L5Checks ; three checkpoint columns (CheckRestart)
$C4B4 L5WaveStarts ; the wave entries of the start and the checkpoints
$C4BA L5Pointers ; objects, map, kinds, movers 1, movers 2
