$D14E b L5Objects 4 ; The level's object table: width, height, the cells' address (LevelObject)
@res levels/level5/objects.bin
$D1EA b L5Metatiles 9 ; The metatiles, 144 bytes each (4 x 4 cells of 9 bytes), numbered down from the map: metatile n at $D4BA - 144 x (n + 1) (MetatileAddress); 5 of them
@res levels/level5/metatiles.bin
$D4BA b L5Map 5 ; The map: 5 bytes a block column (74 columns), each byte a metatile (bits 0-5) and its drawer (bits 6-7)
